      "source": "<a href=\"../AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver</code></a> looks up <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Persistent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Persistent</code></a> and checks for presence of either meta or direct\nusage of <a href=\"../../../annotation/KeySpace.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.annotation\"><code>KeySpace</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver</code></a> 会查找 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Persistent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Persistent</code></a>，并检查是否存在对 <a href=\"../../../annotation/KeySpace.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.annotation\"><code>KeySpace</code></a> 的元数据使用或直接使用。",
